    "Name": "Praetorian PRTN-3M",
    "Details": "The 3M is a missile focused variant, combing Stealth armor with a combined total of six Longfire LRM-15 launchers with attached Artemis IV FCS for high damage surprise strikes from range. In case the 'Mech is directly engaged by foes, two Large and two Medium Pulse Lasers provide some direct fire capabilities. Like several other of the Praetorian designs, the 3M suffers from low cooling potential, limiting its actual damage capabilities.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Superheavy Prototype</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Praetorian"
  },
